gIK(){return"G\xf6revin zaman \xe7izelgesi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfcnde nas\u0131l g\xf6r\xfcnd\xfc\u011f\xfc: \xe7ubuk olarak veya zaman \xe7izelgesinin \xfczerinde a\xe7\u0131klama olarak."},
